WEBVTT

00:03:28.846 --> 00:03:30.134
From afar, they look alien-like,

00:03:30.134 --> 00:03:31.802
but when you look closer,

00:03:31.802 --> 00:03:33.330
they're all made out of black garbage bags

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:34.950
or Tupperware containers.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:37.910
I'd like to share with you how ordinary things

00:03:37.910 --> 00:03:43.418
can become something magical and wondrous.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:04:00.986
(Applause)